# A1/01_greetings.letz

@lesson A1.01 "Basic Greetings"

Moien = morning
Moien = hi
Äddi = bye
Äddi = goodbye
Merci = thanks
Merci = thank you
W.e.g. = please
Jo = yes
Nee = no
Entschëllegt = excuse me
Entschëllegt = sorry
Wéi geet et? = How are you?
Mir geet et gutt = I'm fine
Gudde Moien = Good morning
Gudden Owend = Good evening
Gudde Mëtteg = Good afternoon
Schlof gutt = Sleep well
Bis muer = See you tomorrow
Bis geschwënn = See you soon
